---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';import Hero from '../../components/Hero.astro';import CommunityNav from '../../components/community/CommunityNav.astro';import HackathonRules from "../../components/hackathons/HackathonRules.astro";import FormCta from "../../components/hackathons/FormCta.astro";import { challenges, submissionService } from '../../data/community/submissions';
---
<Layout title="Hackathon Submission Preparation" description="Prepare an AeglysAI six-challenge technical submission, with reproducibility requirements and explicit publication consent. Intake is currently closed."><Hero eyebrow="Community / Technical submissions" title="Prepare a reproducible project." description="One technical offering, six challenge choices. Any programming language; no event date or prize is implied."/><div class="container page-content"><CommunityNav/>{submissionService ? <div class="notice"><h2>Submit through the approved Google Form</h2><p>Registration and submissions use externally configured Google Forms. Administrators review responses in private Google Sheets and keep evidence in private Google Drive. Only approved, sanitized exports may appear on this portal. Review your publication choice before submission.</p><a class="text-link" href={submissionService} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open submission form ↗ (opens in a new tab)</a></div> : <div class="notice"><h2>Submission intake is closed</h2><p>The approved Google submission form is not configured yet. This checklist does not collect, transmit or save data. Do not put personal contact details, credentials or confidential research in a submission.</p></div>}<section class="section"><h2>Register and qualify first</h2><p>Every participant must individually register, fork, clone/run the A/B/C baseline, document architecture and sanitized qualification evidence, and be selected before building. Model D knowledge is not required.</p><FormCta kind="participant" label="Register" id="community-registration-note"/><FormCta kind="qualification" label="Submit Qualification" id="community-qualification-note"/></section><section class="section"><h2>Choose your challenge</h2><ul>{challenges.map(track=><li>{track.title}</li>)}</ul></section><section class="section"><h2>Submission fields</h2><form aria-label="Submission field preview"><fieldset disabled><legend>Preview only — collection unavailable</legend><label>Team ID<input name="team-id" type="text" maxlength="80"/></label><label>Project title<input name="title" type="text" maxlength="160"/></label><label>Challenge choice<select name="challenge">{challenges.map(track=><option value={track.id}>{track.title}</option>)}</select></label><label>Public repository URL<input name="repository" type="url"/></label><label>Project README URL<input name="readme" type="url"/></label><label>Working demonstration video URL — maximum two minutes<input name="video" type="url"/></label><label>Explanation of AI/ML or intelligent technique<textarea name="intelligent-technique"></textarea></label><label>Test or validation evidence<textarea name="validation"></textarea></label><label>Data/model attribution and licensing<textarea name="licensing"></textarea></label><label>Known limitations<textarea name="limitations"></textarea></label><label>Deployed demo URL (optional)<input name="demo" type="url"/></label><label>Short description<textarea name="description" maxlength="1500"></textarea></label><label>Technologies used<input name="technologies" type="text"/></label><label>Reproducibility instructions<textarea name="reproducibility"></textarea></label><label>Publication consent<select name="consent"><option value="false">Not granted</option><option value="true">Explicit permission for reviewed public showcase</option></select></label></fieldset></form><p>Review stages: Received → Pending review → Verified, Rejected or Withdrawn. Verification does not grant publication permission.</p><p>Prepare public-safe repository, exact commit, offline setup/run/test commands, synthetic inputs and actual results. The original five challenge briefs were inspected locally; AI for Everyday Life is a Portal extension pending research COM-003A alignment. Official Google Forms have not been changed. <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/shubh-techie/AeglysAI" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View the research repository ↗</a>. Never create a public issue with private contact information.</p></section><HackathonRules/></div></Layout>
<style>fieldset{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px;}label{display:block;margin-bottom:20px;color:var(--text);}input,select,textarea{display:block;width:100%;margin-top:8px;padding:12px;background:var(--surface);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;box-sizing:border-box;font:inherit;}textarea{min-height:100px;}li{margin:12px 0;}</style>
